Clip.description:
E-20 admin view (API-55): clip.json (clip-pipeline ClipSchema) in snake_case plus pipeline state. Blindness
(NAZAR §6.2): until both ratings of the version exist, a rater sees only `my_rating`, no proposals and no agreement;
`ratings_visible` and `proposals_visible` say what this caller may see. Fields the caller may not see are omitted.

post.description:
Token-gated (MD-139/MD-140): the lab device sends `X-Lab-Token` (one of the API's `LAB_TOKENS`);
without it the route answers 404, like the lab replica itself. `consent_id` must be an active
`field_study` consent artefact of the caller. Participant codes are pseudonymous (`P-017`).
